      "instance_name": "amused_skepticism",
      "label": "amused skepticism expression",
      "description": "Christopher Lee's facial expression combines a slight smile with raised eyebrows and a furrowed brow, conveying a mix of amusement at the absurdity of the proposition and a skeptical disbelief that someone would actually accept such a deal. His expression is not overtly angry or sad, but rather a dry, knowing amusement that contrasts with the ridiculousness of the text.",
